# Software Factory

Start or resume with the plugin's `software-factory` skill. Explicitly invoke
entry/admin skills by name: software-factory, sf-help, sf-agents, sf-evolve,
sf-eval and sf-principles. Working skills remain available automatically.

The plugin supplies skills, role prompts and recovery hooks. Project setup
and BMad provisioning use the separate project installer. Runtime state belongs
to the consumer project's `.software-factory/` directory. A recovery pointer
is context to reconcile, never authorization to dispatch more work.
